      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Highway Route Transit Logistics &amp; Corridor Operations from Surat to Mumbai (303 km)</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;">
<p>Transporting goods between Surat and Mumbai is a common need for both individuals and businesses. To ensure a smooth and secure journey, a comprehensive operational transit analysis is essential. Below, we will outline the key aspects for a seamless transportation experience:</p>

<h3>Route Selection: NH 19/NH 27/NH 48 (Golden Quadrilateral West Corridor)</h3>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
