<h3>Satellite GPS Checkpoints</h3>
<p>To track the movement of the transportation vehicle and ensure safe passage, we recommend using satellite GPS tracking technology. This ensures real-time monitoring of the vehicle's location, speed, and potential hazards along the route.</p>
