      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>The logistics corridor connecting Surat to Mumbai presents unique challenges, primarily stemming from consistent highway vibration and the unpredictable intensity of the monsoon season. To ensure the integrity of high-value cargo, professional entities like Ganpati Packers and Movers Surat and Agrawal Big Packers and Movers Surat have refined a multi-layered packaging protocol.</p>
<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">This strategy is designed to mitigate shock and moisture damage, setting a standard that influences how services operate for movers and packers Mumbai to Surat and even for entities handling mumbai to surat transport routes.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>By combining robust physical barriers with weather-resistant sealing, this protocol addresses the specific mechanical stresses encountered on this particular highway stretch.</span></li></ul>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #f59e0b22; color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">01</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Protocol 01</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The foundational layer utilizes 80-GSM heavy-duty air-bubble wrap to provide immediate cushioning against micro-vibrations. This material is applied generously around fragile items to absorb kinetic energy generated by truck suspension movements, ensuring that delicate glassware and electronics remain secure throughout the journey.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-top: 10px;">
