      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Statutory Interstate e-Way Bills, Regulatory Clearances &amp; 100% Marine Insurance for packers and movers surat to mumbai</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;">
	<p>When you hire a professional packers and movers service for relocating your household or office items from Surat to Mumbai, it is crucial to understand the different types of statutory transit paperwork and risk coverage involved.</p>

	<p>GST E-Way Bills are mandatory for all inter-state movements of goods that involve a consignor, consignee, and a carrier (in this case, the packers and movers). These bills help track the movement of goods and ensure tax collection at source.</p>
	<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #f59e0b22; color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">01</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Consignor</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The person who is delivering the goods (in this case, the packers and movers)</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Consignee</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The person receiving the goods (in this case, you, the customer)</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">03</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Carrier</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The packers and movers or any other person transporting the goods</p>
  </div>
</div>
	<p>When hiring a packers and movers service, ensure that they are aware of the rules and procedures regarding GST E-Way Bills and assist you in completing the necessary paperwork.</p>

	<p>If you choose a reputable packers and movers service, they will provide you with IBA (Indian Banks Association)-approved Lorry Receipts (LR/Bilty). These documents serve as proof of the consignment being loaded into the vehicle and is required for customs clearance while crossing state boundaries.</p>
	<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Lorry Receipt (LR): It is a document issued by the carrier to the consignor for the goods transported.</span></li>
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Bilty: It is a document issued by the carrier to the consignee for the goods transported.</span></li>
	</ul>
	<p>IBA approval ensures the authenticity of the documents and ensures that the packers and movers are adhering to industry standards.</p>

	<p>Risk coverage is essential to protect your valuable belongings during the relocation process. Ensure that the packers and movers provide a comprehensive risk coverage plan to ensure your peace of mind.</p>
	<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Comprehensive Insurance:</strong> This type of insurance covers your goods against damage or loss during transportation. A reputable packers and movers service will provide a comprehensive insurance policy that covers accidental collision, theft, and other unforeseen damages.</span></li>
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Comprehensive Risk Coverage:</strong> This coverage is similar to comprehensive insurance, but it also includes coverage for unforeseen delays caused by roadblocks, traffic jams, or any other unforeseen circumstances.</span></li>
	</ul>
	<p>It is essential to check the coverage details and confirm that they comply with your requirements.</p>
